Conjures up a bolt of cold that moves toward the target and explodes into a chilly circle of death, doing [172, 231, 277, 316, 351 (TL1-5; SP 100)] cold damage in a radius of [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)].

Necrotic minions caught in the blast do not take damage but are instead coated with a thin layer of ice, reducing all damage they take by [5, 11, 16, 21, 25 (TL1-5)] for 4 turns.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
